<!-- PLACEHOLDER brand mark, a location pin carrying a heart, until an approved logo exists
     (docs/design/BRAND-ASSETS.md). This one file is the mark on the system splash and in the
     app: replacing it replaces both. Colours come from the design tokens.

     The canvas is 256 units with the mark in its middle 120. Android 12+ draws a splash icon
     without a background by scaling the whole drawable into its own box, so the mark keeps its
     proportion only if the margin is part of the drawable, not a fixed inset. The app's splash
     draws the same canvas and shows the mark at BrandMarkSize. -->
